{title: Tum Agar Saath Dene Ka Vaada Karo}
{artist: Mahendra Kapoor Ravi}
{key: B}

{c: Verse 1}
[B]Tum Agar Saath Dene Ka [E]Vada Karo,        Mai [B]Yunhi Mast [E]Nagme [B]Lutata Rahu
[B]Tum Mujhe Dekh Kar Musku [E]rati Raho,        Mai [B]Tumhe Dekh [E]Kar Geet [B]Gata Rahu
[B]Kitne Jalwe Fizaonme [F#]Bikhare Magar,        Maine [E]Ab Tak Kisi Ko [B]Pukara Nahin
[B]Tumko Dekha To Nazre Ye [F#]Kehne Lagi,        Humko [E]Chehre Se Hatna [B]Gavara Nahin
[B]Tum Agar Meri Nazron Ke [E]Aage Raho,
Mai Har [B]Ek Shaiy Se [E]Nazre [B]Churata Rahu
[B]Maine Khwabon Mein Barson [F#]Tarasha Jise
Tum [E]Vahi Sang-E-Marmar Ki [B]Tasveer Ho
[B]Tum Na Samjho Tumhara [F#]Muqadar Hu Mai
Maein [E]Samajhta Hoon Tum Meri [B]Taqdeer Ho
[B]Tum Agar Mujhko Apna [E]Samajhne Lago
Men [B]Bahaaron Ki [E]Mehfil [B]Sajata Rahoon,
